* File and directory structures

   scripts/             : Gfarm Zabbix plugin
      externalscripts/  : scripts to monitor Gfarm
      zabbix_agent.d/   : configuration file for user parameters
   templates/           : templates for the plugin
   install-agent.sh     : install script for Gfarm Zabbix plugin
   install.conf         : configuration file for install scripts
   README.en            : this file
